{[%cal Ge8f8,Ge8e7,Ge8c8,Yd1d7,Yd1a4,Rc7e7,Rc7f7] Black "only" has to survive the next few moves here. Step one is to find all candidate moves. Then each move has to be calculated and refuted until the solution is found.} 1... Qa4 (1... Qd7 2. Bxg7 Qxg7 3. Qxe8+ Kh7 4. Qxh5+ Kg8 5.
Rg3) (1... Rf8 2. Bxg7 Rxg7 3. Qxe6+ Rgf7 (3... Rff7 4. Qe8+) 4. Rg3+ (4. Qg6+
Rg7) 4... Kh7 5. Qg6+ Kh8 6. Qh6+ Rh7 7. Qxf8#) (1... Ree7 2. Bxg7 (2. Rd3) (2.
Bxe7 Rxe7 3. Rd3) 2... Rxg7 3. Qe8+ (3. Qxe6+ Kh7 4. Rf6 Rxg2+ 5. Kxg2 Rg7+)
3... Kh7 4. Qxh5+ Kg8 5. Rf8+ Kxf8 6. Qxd1) (1... Rd8 2. Rg3 Rdd7 3. Qe8+ Kh7
4. Rg5 $18) (1... Rec8 2. Bxg7 Rxg7 3. Qxe6+ Kh7 4. Qxc8 $18) (1... Rf7 2. Bxg7
Rxf3 3. Bf6+ $1) 2. Rg3 Ree7 3. Bxe7 Rxe7 4. Qxh5 Qxa2 *
